## Settings › Devices: gamepads and 3Dconnexion SpaceMouse for moving around large images,
## slides and 3D views. "SpaceMouse" and "spacenavd" are names, left as they are.

settings-section-devices = Devices
settings-devices-enabled = Use gamepads and SpaceMouse
