    Off: { -app-name } doesn’t open them.
settings-devices-dead-zone = Dead zone
settings-devices-dead-zone-help = How far a stick or the cap moves before anything happens.
settings-devices-speed = Speed
settings-devices-speed-help = How fast the view moves at full push.
settings-devices-look-again = Look again
settings-devices-look-again-help = Look for devices connected since.
